hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-46 = cons "**Science.** A field's knowledge becomes a graph of constructions over its observations. Two schools that disagree" (cons "are two families of constructions, and the fiber compatible with both observations shows what is actually" (cons "unsettled. Replication is reuse under a valid certificate. A retracted result invalidates exactly what depended on" (cons "it." (cons "" (cons "**Organizations.** The whole of an institution (its systems, its records, its reasoning and its decisions) becomes" (cons "one program with end-to-end verifiability of any provable property. The knowledge graph of the organization and the" (cons "organization's computation are the same object." (cons "" (cons "**Machine intelligence.** A language model's weights hold the usage history of the human record without identity," (cons "justification or currency. A knowledge graph of constructions gives what the model lacks: claims tied to their" (cons "warrants, identities with witnesses, and conclusions that know their dependencies. A model working inside it is an" (cons "executor of code over that graph, and its outputs become objects whose correctness is relative to what they serve." (cons "" (cons "**Communication.** Two people who disagree hold two constructions. The system can show the shared premises and" (cons "where inference over them diverges, so disagreement becomes navigable." (cons "" nil))))))))))))))))
